  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Climate Crisis Response Capacity through Monitoring and Management of Coastal Sargassum Events in the Dominican Republi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Capacity building for sargassum management in response to the sargassum issues around shores of dominican republic through the improvement on monitoring by using prevetion system, data collecting, processing and investigation&#xb3c4;&#xbbf8;&#xb2c8;&#xce74;&#xacf5;&#xd654;&#xad6d; &#xbaa8;&#xc790;&#xbc18; &#xd53c;&#xd574; &#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">establishment of integrated management plan through early warning of sargassum flows, data collecting and processing method development, Capacity building of the local communities for sargassum managment concerning sustainable economy. Monitoring and Investigation for improving the understanding of the economic and ecological impacts of sargassum in DR</narrative>
  </description>
